\details{
Provides methods for creating and managing Binance sub-accounts,
querying balances, performing universal transfers, and retrieving
futures/margin account details. Inherits from \link{BinanceBase}.
\subsection{Purpose and Scope}{
\itemize{
\item \strong{Sub-Account Creation}: Create virtual sub-accounts programmatically.
\item \strong{Balance Queries}: Retrieve asset balances for any sub-account.
\item \strong{Universal Transfers}: Move funds between master and sub-accounts across
SPOT, USDT_FUTURE, COIN_FUTURE, MARGIN, and ISOLATED_MARGIN wallets.
\item \strong{Account Details}: Query futures and margin account information for sub-accounts.
\item \strong{Status}: Retrieve sub-account enablement and activity status.
}
}

\subsection{Usage}{

All methods require authentication (valid API key and secret).
These are wallet (\verb{/sapi/}) endpoints.
}

\subsection{Official Documentation}{

\href{https://developers.binance.com/docs/sub_account/Introduction}{Binance Sub-Account Endpoints}
}

